WEBVTT

00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:32.612
a growing number of companies
are offering a four-day,

00:00:32.612 --> 00:00:34.697
32-hour week,

00:00:34.739 --> 00:00:36.824
but with five days of pay.

00:00:37.408 --> 00:00:39.368
Now, it's not a new idea,

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:42.330
but the pandemic has turbocharged it.

00:00:42.371 --> 00:00:44.165
Employers are realizing

00:00:44.207 --> 00:00:47.001
that if they can rethink
where people work,

00:00:47.043 --> 00:00:50.505
they can also rethink
how many days they're on the job.

00:00:51.214 --> 00:00:55.593
Sounds pretty great, but is it realistic?

00:00:56.135 --> 00:00:58.096
Well, actually, yes.

00:00:58.638 --> 00:01:03.184
Unlike policies in which one party
profits at the expense of another,